  "prompt": "Compare the five-year cost of owning an EV versus a gas car. EV: $38,000 purchase, $0.04 per mile for energy, $400 a year maintenance. Gas: $30,000 purchase, $0.13 per mile for fuel, $900 a year maintenance. I drive 12,000 miles a year.",
